{
  "id": "ISA.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 3",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu ogotantanigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naama! Omonene, oyore Omonene bw’Emeganda, narusie korwa ase Yerusalemu, na korwa ase Abayuda, kera egento basemeretie na ebi begenete; narusieo endagera yonsi, na amaache onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Narusie korwao abanto bare chituoni na abarwani bande b’esegi, na abagaambi ebiina, na ababani, na abaringoria, na abagaaka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na abatang’ani b’abarwani emerongo etano, na abanto abasike, na abasemia, na abaroisia abang’aini, na abaragori bamanyete oborogi mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nabeeke abasae babe abanene babo, na abana abake baabagambere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto mbachandane, kera omonto nabe ogochanda oyonde, na kera omonto nabe ogochanda omogisangio oye; omwana omoke naenenere omonto omogotu, na omonto otaroochi nchera nachaye omonto osikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki eyio omonto nabwate oyomwabo baiboire komo amoteebie, “Aye nobwate chianga okobeeka, ase ayio kabe omogambi oito, otenenere obogaambi obo bwanyegerigwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase rituko erio oyio nakane ateebe: “Inche tinkonyara koba omogwenia; ase enyomba yane endagera teiyo, gose eanga, ase ayio timokonyara kombeeka imbe omoraai bw’abaanto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu otagoirwe, na Abayuda bagure, ekiagera chinkwana chiabo na ogokora kwabo biabeire mamincha y’Omonene, basiereiri, Obonene bwa Nyasae gati yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okororekana kw’amaiso abo kwababereire kirori; nigo bakoraria ebibe biabo buna Abasodomu bakorete, tibari kobibisa. Obobe nobwabo! Barabwo abanyene berenteire obobe obwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teebia abanyene oboronge ng’a amang’ana nabe amaya ase bare, barabwo mbarie okwama kw’ogokora kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobe nobwabo abakori amabe! Amang’ana nabe amabe ase bare, ekiagera aya amaboko abo abeire agokora, naro barakorerwe abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baane nigo bagochandwa nabana, na abakungu nabwo bakobagaambera. Inwe abanto baane, abaraai baino baabatantanirie enchera, babasiririe ase enchera mogoeta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene okonachera ebisaku ekiina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene obeire ang’e korenta ekiina, otenenire konachera ebisaku ekiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nachake kogambia abagaaka na abagaambi b’abaanto baye, ateebe, “Ninwe mwasaririe omogondo one bw’emesabibu, na ebisakorwa bi’abataka nigo bire ase chinyomba chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene bw’Emeganda, nigo nkoboria iga: Ninki mokorengereria goika mwasunyuntire abanto baane na gosia amasio ’abataka?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokuurerwa kw’abakuungu ba Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo agoteeba, “Abakungu ba Sayoni nigo bare aberori, nigo bagotaara basongorete amagoti, na bagoaka‐akania amaiso are nokogania okobe; nigo bagotira‐tiria kobakogenda na kwogia chinchigiri chire amagoro abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene nae abakungu ba Sayoni oborwaire bw’ogosunyora chitukia chiabo, naende abaasiorie chianga abatige bare getirianda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko eri’Omonene nabaure ebinto bionsi bechaberete: ebitange bi’amagoro, na ebitinti, ne chisonoi chi’amagoti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ebigera bi’amato, ne chitaai chi’amaboko, na ebiechabero bia metwe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ebinyuri bi’amagoro, ne chinkini chi’okweboeria, ne chichuba chire namaguta agotioka, na ebite bi’ogwekong’era,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne chibonyi chire nebimanyererio, na ebigera bie chimioro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne chiganchwa chi’emeyega, ne chigoti chi’okwambara, na ebiambaro bi’amareko, na emebuko ya koboko,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ebirore, ne chianga chi’egatani chie rigori rinene, na ebigogwa, na ebietubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ribaga ri’ogotioka okuya nobogundo borabeo, ne ribaga ri’orokini nengori eraabeo, ne ribaga ri’etukia eroisirie buya nerisio rirabeo, ne ribaga ri’okobeeka chiganchwa chi’emeyega mweboyie chigunia, obuya bwabo mboonchoke bobe obosoku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baino mbaitwe nemioro, na abarwani baino chituoni mbakwere ase esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiita bi’omochie oyio mbirere na kobokia amagombo; n’omochie oyio nobe buna omokungu ourirwe kera egento oinkaransete amaroba igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ISA.4",
    "number": "4",
    "bookId": "ISA"
  },
